Modifications add context preparation, authoritative admission, and durable
message replacement, and preserve ordinary developer content during tool-update
projection. The source proposal is in proposals/dsh-developer-admission.patch.

DSH Context OS is an independent community plugin and is not an official
DeepSeek product. Host applications provide their own authentication and
resource services; they are not included in this distribution.
